# NRC: the neural radiance cache (Mueller et al. 2021; Engine/Graphic/Neural/NeuralRadianceCache.hpp, contract Notion Wiki
# «NRC — контракт»). PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc: the path tracer's paths end in the cache where their spread passes the
# threshold (or at the bounce limit), the cache trains online every frame from sparse training paths (self-training), and
# the composite adds T * cache(x) * (D_d + D_s) into the accumulation and the denoiser's lobe sums.
Дано F:/BistroFoliageProj dnx_Night_pt, GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced, Reflections.Method PathTraced (the path tracer integrates both; GI alone is lowered to HardwareTraced), PathTracing.Denoiser Off, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 1, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 1 (PT 1 spp), camera fixed on the street.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc; shoot nrc after 120 frames; DesertCtl state nrc.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Off; shoot off after 120 frames.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Off, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 64; shoot ref after 120 frames.
Тогда [nrc_night]: RMSE(nrc, ref) < RMSE(off, ref) (the cache's frame is closer to the 64 spp reference than the plain 1 spp frame); mean luminance of nrc within 5 % of ref; state nrc: active true, kernelPath named, trainingSamples > 0, renderQueries > 0, trainLoss < firstTrainLoss (the loss falls); 0 VUID in the log.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 1, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 1, machine.json without ForcedNeuralKernelPath; 120 frames; DesertCtl state nrc (kernelPath K0 - the device's own path, rebuilds R0); run Neural "Neural: Kernel path P" with P a path device.nn lists and != K0 (Fp32 on a device whose own path is Fp16 or CoopMatFp16, else Fp16); 120 frames; shoot nrc_forced; DesertCtl state nrc; run Neural "Neural: Kernel path Auto"; 120 frames; shoot nrc_auto; DesertCtl state nrc.
Тогда [nrc_kernel_switch]: after the switch state nrc kernelPath P, rebuilds R0 + 1, active true, trainingSteps not above its value before the switch (the new cache trained 120 frames from zero, not 240); after Auto kernelPath K0, rebuilds R0 + 2, active true; editor.log has exactly one "[PathTracer] radiance cache rebuilt (ForcedNeuralKernelPath none -> P" and one "(ForcedNeuralKernelPath P -> none" line; the PT frame keeps converging: nrc_forced and nrc_auto are not black and each is within the nrc_night bounds (RMSE to ref below RMSE(off, ref), mean luminance within 5 % of ref); 0 VUID in the log.
Когда PathTracing.RadianceCache Nrc, PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 1, PathTracing.PathsPerFrame 1, machine.json without ForcedNeuralKernelPath; 120 frames; DesertCtl state nrc (rebuilds R0, programGenerations G0); touch Editor/Resources/Shaders/Programs/PathTracing/PathTracerResolve.shader (an unrelated program: the hot-reload poll recompiles it, ShaderService::Recompile); 120 frames; shoot nrc_unrelated; DesertCtl state nrc; touch Editor/Resources/Shaders/Programs/Compute/NeuralRadianceCache.shader (one of the cache's own programs); 120 frames; shoot nrc_own; DesertCtl state nrc.
Тогда [nrc_recompile_scope]: after the unrelated recompile state nrc rebuilds R0 and programGenerations G0 (unchanged), trainingSteps above its value before (the cache kept training, not restarted), editor.log has no new "[PathTracer] radiance cache rebuilt" line; after the own recompile rebuilds R0 + 1, programGenerations NeuralRadianceCache above G0's and NeuralFusedMlp equal to G0's, active true, trainingSteps not above 120 frames' worth (a fresh cache), and exactly one "[PathTracer] radiance cache rebuilt (ForcedNeuralKernelPath none -> none, program generations" line; the PT frame keeps converging: nrc_unrelated and nrc_own are not black and each is within the nrc_night bounds (RMSE to ref below RMSE(off, ref), mean luminance within 5 % of ref); 0 VUID in the log.
